# Provider credentials — TEMPLATE. This file is never applied, and never
# holds a real key.
#
# The extension is `.yaml.example` on purpose: `kubectl apply -f deploy/`
# reads only `.yaml`, `.yml`, and `.json`, so this file cannot be swept up by
# the directory apply. That matters more than it looks. A real
# `deploy/secret.yaml` carrying placeholders would overwrite the operator's
# live credential with `REPLACE_ME` on the next `kubectl apply -f deploy/` —
# every provider call 401s, and the manifest set that "converges the cluster"
# is what broke it. Credentials are the one thing in this directory that the
# cluster owns and git does not.
#
# Create the real Secret out of band, from a file rather than a literal so the
# key never lands in shell history or `ps` output:
#
#   kubectl -n llm create secret generic llm-gateway-provider-keys \
#     --from-file=openai=./openai.key \
#     --from-file=anthropic=./anthropic.key \
#     --dry-run=client -o yaml | kubectl apply -f -
#
# Rotation is the same command with a new value, and it needs no restart: the
# kubelet updates the mounted files in place and the provider key cache picks
# the new value up on that provider's next refresh (ADR-001, decision #1).
#
# One data key per provider, and the names are not free-form — they are the
# filenames `secret_source.providers[].path` points at in `configmap.yaml`
# (`/etc/gateway/keys/openai`, `/etc/gateway/keys/anthropic`). A Secret volume
# projects one file per data key, which is why `kind: file` needs no format:
# each file holds exactly one credential, read as its bytes, trimmed.
#
# ollama is absent on purpose — the in-cluster route is unauthenticated, and
# that absence is how a keyless provider is declared, not an oversight.
#
# The pod starts without this Secret (`optional: true` in `deployment.yaml`).
# A missing credential is not a boot failure: it gates readiness, so the pod
# refuses traffic rather than serving requests it cannot fulfil. Locally,
# `deploy/dev/provider-keys.yaml` supplies deliberately fake values instead —
# see `docs/local-testing.md`.
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: llm-gateway-provider-keys
  namespace: llm
  labels:
    app: llm-gateway
type: Opaque
stringData:
  openai: REPLACE_ME
  anthropic: REPLACE_ME
